value="
* GENERATED by generator/emit_pads.py -- DO NOT EDIT BY HAND
* backend: sky130   pdk: sky130A
* topology: specs/pads/topology.yaml v1 (DDR1 VREF receiver, shared across PDKs)
* STATUS: topology_template_only
* SIZE UNITS: topology params are metres; sky130 subckts use .option scale=1u (micrometres), apply x1e6 when filling
* ESD NOTE: 2-terminal .model diodes; area unit and clamp orientation still need schematic review
* DDR1 decision for this backend: TBD
* 2.5 V operating point is not a characterized IO library; VREF receiver is topology only
*
* NOT SIMULATABLE. W / I / common-mode / offset / hysteresis are all
* unresolved parameters (required_params.json). ngspice rejects them
* until filled. The ideal tail current source is a placeholder for a
* characterized current mirror, not a designed bias circuit.
*
* Expected includes (NOT bundled): libs.tech/ngspice/sky130.lib.spice (corner section tt/ss/ff) ; none (device models only)
*
* Device-instantiation syntax is per backend; the differential-pair
* topology is shared. See specs/pads/devices/<backend>.yaml.
*
* DDR1 read capture topology:
*   PAD and VREF are both VDDIO-domain inputs -> IO devices only.
*   Differential pair + PMOS mirror load -> single-ended -> RX buffer.
*   No DAC, no ADC, no digital output driver on the VREF pad.

* --- differential pair ---
X_VP n_outp PAD n_tail VSSIO sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=W_VREF_N l=L_PDRV nf=NF_DEVICE m=M_DEVICE
X_VN n_outn VREF n_tail VSSIO sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=W_VREF_N l=L_PDRV nf=NF_DEVICE m=M_DEVICE
* --- tail current: ideal placeholder ---
I_TAIL n_tail VSSIO DC I_TAIL
* W_TAIL belongs to the real current mirror, TBD.
* --- PMOS current-mirror load ---
X_LP n_outp n_outp VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=W_LOAD l=L_PDRV nf=NF_DEVICE m=M_DEVICE
X_LN n_outn n_outp VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=W_LOAD l=L_PDRV nf=NF_DEVICE m=M_DEVICE
* --- single-ended output buffer ---
X_RX_N IN n_outn VSSIO VSSIO sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=W_RX_N l=L_PDRV nf=NF_DEVICE m=M_DEVICE
X_RX_P IN n_outn VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=W_RX_P l=L_PDRV nf=NF_DEVICE m=M_DEVICE
* Unresolved: VREF_CM_MIN / VREF_CM_MAX / VREF_OFFSET / VREF_HYST.
* Common-mode range, offset and hysteresis are NOT reported here.

* VREF pad: ESD diodes + metal ONLY. No output driver, no DAC/ADC.
D_VREF_UP VREF VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__diode_pd2nw_11v0 area=ESD_AREA_UP
D_VREF_DN VSSIO VREF sky130_fd_pr__diode_pw2nd_11v0 area=ESD_AREA_DN
"}
